      "summaries": {
        "en": "qBittorrent is a free, open-source BitTorrent client that aims to provide a lightweight, fast, and feature-rich alternative to proprietary clients like uTorrent. Its key technical strength lies in its C++ implementation using the libtorrent library, offering efficient peer-to-peer file sharing with minimal resource usage. Built with Qt, it provides a native cross-platform experience across Windows, macOS, and Linux. Users can easily manage downloads, stream media, and search for torrents via built-in plugins. Ideal for anyone needing a reliable, ad-free torrent client with advanced features like RSS support and IP filtering.",
        "zh": "qBittorrent 是一款免费开源的 BitTorrent 客户端，旨在替代 uTorrent 等专有软件，提供轻量、快速且功能丰富的 P2P 文件共享体验。其核心技术优势在于使用 C++ 和 libtorrent 库实现，资源占用低、传输效率高，并通过 Qt 框架实现跨平台原生支持（Windows、macOS、Linux）。用户可通过内置插件搜索种子、管理下载队列、流媒体播放，并支持 RSS 订阅和 IP 过滤等高级功能。适合追求无广告、稳定可靠的下载工具的用户，无论是日常文件分享还是大规模资源分发，都能轻松应对。",
        "es": "qBittorrent is a free, open-source BitTorrent client that aims to provide a lightweight, fast, and feature-rich alternative to proprietary clients like uTorrent. Its key technical strength lies in its C++ implementation using the libtorrent library, offering efficient peer-to-peer file sharing with minimal resource usage. Built with Qt, it provides a native cross-platform experience across Windows, macOS, and Linux. Users can easily manage downloads, stream media, and search for torrents via built-in plugins. Ideal for anyone needing a reliable, ad-free torrent client with advanced features like RSS support and IP filtering.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "qBittorrent stands out for bittorrent, bittorrent-client, and c-plus-plus in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "qBittorrent is a free, open-source BitTorrent client that aims to provide a lightweight, fast, and feature-rich alternative to proprietary clients like uTorrent. Its key technical strength lies in its C++ implementation using the libtorrent library, offering efficient peer-to-peer file sharing with minimal resource usage. Built with Qt, it provides a native cross-platform experience across Windows, macOS, and Linux. Users can easily manage downloads, stream media, and search for torrents via built-in plugins. Ideal for anyone needing a reliable, ad-free torrent client with advanced features like RSS support and IP filtering.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/qbittorrent/qBittorrent for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
