      "summaries": {
        "en": "Docuseal is an open-source alternative to DocuSign for creating, filling, and signing digital documents. Built with Ruby on Rails, it uses Hotwired Turbo for real-time interactions and Tailwind CSS for a clean UI. Its self-hosted nature gives you full control over data and workflows. You can deploy it on your own server, customize templates, and integrate via API. Ideal for businesses needing secure, compliant e-signatures without vendor lock-in.",
        "zh": "Docuseal 是一款开源的电子签名工具，旨在替代 DocuSign，让用户能够创建、填写和签署数字文档。它基于 Ruby on Rails 构建，利用 Hotwired Turbo 实现实时交互，并使用 Tailwind CSS 打造简洁界面。其核心优势在于支持自托管，让你完全掌控数据和流程。你可以将其部署在自己的服务器上，自定义文档模板，并通过 API 集成到现有系统。对于需要安全、合规的电子签名服务且希望避免供应商锁定的企业来说，Docuseal 是一个理想选择。",
        "es": "Docuseal is an open-source alternative to DocuSign for creating, filling, and signing digital documents. Built with Ruby on Rails, it uses Hotwired Turbo for real-time interactions and Tailwind CSS for a clean UI. Its self-hosted nature gives you full control over data and workflows. You can deploy it on your own server, customize templates, and integrate via API. Ideal for businesses needing secure, compliant e-signatures without vendor lock-in.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "docuseal stands out for document-signing, documents, and e-signature in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Docuseal is an open-source alternative to DocuSign for creating, filling, and signing digital documents. Built with Ruby on Rails, it uses Hotwired Turbo for real-time interactions and Tailwind CSS for a clean UI. Its self-hosted nature gives you full control over data and workflows. You can deploy it on your own server, customize templates, and integrate via API. Ideal for businesses needing secure, compliant e-signatures without vendor lock-in.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/docusealco/docuseal for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
