      "summaries": {
        "en": "Cocoindex is an incremental data indexing engine designed for long-horizon AI agents that need to maintain up-to-date context from evolving data sources. Its core innovation is change-data-capture (CDC) combined with incremental processing, enabling agents to efficiently track and index only new or modified data rather than reprocessing everything. This makes it ideal for applications like codebase intelligence, where agents must stay synchronized with a rapidly changing repository. Developers can use Cocoindex to build custom pipelines that feed fresh, structured context into their agents, reducing latency and computational overhead.",
        "zh": "Cocoindex 是一个专为长周期 AI 智能体设计的增量数据索引引擎，核心解决智能体如何高效跟踪并索引动态变化数据源的问题。其技术亮点在于结合变更数据捕获（CDC）与增量处理机制，使智能体仅需处理新增或修改的数据，而非全量重算，从而大幅降低延迟与计算成本。这一设计特别适用于代码库智能等场景，智能体需实时同步仓库变更以保持上下文新鲜。开发者可利用 Cocoindex 构建自定义流水线，将结构化上下文持续注入智能体，提升其决策时效性。",
        "es": "Cocoindex is an incremental data indexing engine designed for long-horizon AI agents that need to maintain up-to-date context from evolving data sources. Its core innovation is change-data-capture (CDC) combined with incremental processing, enabling agents to efficiently track and index only new or modified data rather than reprocessing everything. This makes it ideal for applications like codebase intelligence, where agents must stay synchronized with a rapidly changing repository. Developers can use Cocoindex to build custom pipelines that feed fresh, structured context into their agents, reducing latency and computational overhead.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "cocoindex stands out for agentic-data-framework, ai, and ai-agents in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Cocoindex is an incremental data indexing engine designed for long-horizon AI agents that need to maintain up-to-date context from evolving data sources. Its core innovation is change-data-capture (CDC) combined with incremental processing, enabling agents to efficiently track and index only new or modified data rather than reprocessing everything. This makes it ideal for applications like codebase intelligence, where agents must stay synchronized with a rapidly changing repository. Developers can use Cocoindex to build custom pipelines that feed fresh, structured context into their agents, reducing latency and computational overhead.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/cocoindex-io/cocoindex for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
